        </div>
       </div>
       <p data-template-id="submit-note" style="font-size:15.9995px;font-weight:400;color:rgb(104, 99, 108)" class="canva-text mt-6 mb-4">Your answers save automatically in this browser. When you are finished, use the buttons below to download a copy of your work or save the assignment as a PDF to email to Pietro.</p><button id="submit-button" type="submit" class="submit canva-button"><span data-template-id="submit-label" style="font-size:15.9995px;font-weight:700;color:rgb(255, 255, 255)" class="canva-text">Submit assignment</span><span data-template-id="submitting-label" style="font-size:15.9995px;font-weight:700;